<title>USA: CVS Corp June same-store sales rise.</title>
<headline>CVS Corp June same-store sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>WOONSOCKET, R.I. 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Percent change</p>
<p>		    1997	 1996	     Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month	     $1,200     $1,020     +17.9	 +9.9</p>
<p>Year-to-date    $6,320     $5,250     +20.3	+17.5</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures in millions except percentage.</p>
<p>Figures include Revco stores. Same-store sales for CVS excluding Revco are up 9.5 pct for June and up 11.9 pct year-to-date.</p>
<p>    Month is   five weeks ended	 June 28.</p>
</text>
